class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025, August to September came in at 55% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 52%. Grid 19417 had its driest year in 2001 at 59%.</p>"}
